OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after mobility
OL,4,Ascooter rider injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 90s has been seriously
OL,7,Finjured after his mobility scooter was
OL,8,Finvolved in a collision at a pedestrian
OL,9,Fcrossing, police have said.
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police said it
OL,12,Fhappened in Raunds at about 10:40 BST
OL,13,Fon Thursday.
OL,15,FA white Peugeot 308 was in collision
OL,16,Fwith a black Scooterpac mobility
OL,17,Fscooter crossing London Road, near the
OL,18,Fjunction with Marshalls Road.
OL,20,FA 79-year-old man, from Raunds, was
OL,21,Farrested on suspicion of causing
OL,22,Fserious injury by dangerous driving.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
